Standard: the current values.
Vanilla: no premium on everyday purchases, at most 1.5x for special demand (vanilla customers pay the negotiated price; price events are most often +50%)—
· Milo's fake Hemingways: 2x → 1.5x;
· Seline's everyday purchases: 1.2x → 1x, Blue Blood: 3x → 1.5x;
· unchanged: Isa's Synapse 1.5x, Seline's story luxury purchases 1.3x, Doreen's Hydra 400₵; Isa's and Rosen's everyday purchases never had a premium.

Standard: the current values.
Vanilla: tuned to the base game—
· Solana VIPs bring 800 + random 0–250 + the day (Standard: 3000–5000); the richest vanilla customers bring 750–1000 + day;
· the lab buyer pays 1.5x for everything on the list (Standard: 2x, Blue Blood 3x); vanilla price events are most often +50%;
· Stamina Boosters add at most +2 scavenging attempts in total (Standard: +1 per shot, no cap); the vanilla Proficient Scavenger perk gives +2;
· Rosen sells wholesale at 20% off (Standard: 30%); vanilla suppliers give 20% off.

